SUMMARY:(CXLD) Leaving a Legacy: Family and Organization Histories
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. \n\nIf you don't tell your 
 story\, who will?  Learn how to start and what's involved in capturing the 
 history of your family or organization for posterity.  We'll cover 
