SUMMARY:(CXLD) Microsoft Excel: PivotTables
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nThis hands-on course introduces one of Excel’s most powerful 
 tools for summarizing and analyzing data – PivotTables. Students will 
 learn how to evaluate data\, create and rearrange PivotTables\, sort and 
 filter information\, refresh data\, and drill down to view details. The 
 course also covers formatting a PivotTable\, inserting slicers\, and 
 turning the data into a PivotChart.\nPrerequisites:\n        Basic computer 
 skills (keyboard\, mouse\, file management)\n        Experience working 
 with Excel worksheets\n        Familiarity with entering data and using 
 simple Excel features (such as selecting cells and creating basic formulas)
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
