SUMMARY:(CXLD) The Sonnet: Talk and Writing Workshop NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class.\n\nA two-part 
 lecture/discussion and hands on workshop. We will explore the surprising 
 multicultural Sicilian roots of the sonnet form\, in the Palermo court of 
 Frederick II Holy Roman Emperor ("wonder of the world"). Then (in honor 
 also of Shakespeare's birthday!) we will write our own sonnets\, with step 
 by step support for those who would like it!\n
