SUMMARY:Microsoft Excel I
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\n\nExcel is Microsoft 365 software that organizes and analyzes 
 information in spreadsheet format. It has a wide array of tools for data 
 analysis.  Excel provides options for presenting complex data via charts 
 and graphs.\n\nThe class is geared to beginners and those who seek a 
 refresher in the topic.  Students will gain a basic understanding of the 
 worksheet environment\, tools for working with data\, and resources for 
 continued learning.\n\nWhat you will learn\nWorksheet basics with budget 
 practice worksheet - Learn elements of the worksheet\, enter and edit 
 budget data\, perform calculations\, create a pie chart.\n\nImportant 
 Note\nThis is a hands-on class\; students should have ability to use the 
 mouse and keyboard.  Students are welcome to bring a flash drive to save 
 their work for review and practice.\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
