SUMMARY:CANCELLED: Make It Rhyme: Empowering Young Poets (Recommended Grades 3-5)
DESCRIPTION:Please note that the May 3rd session has been cancelled. Our 
 apologies for any inconvenience.\n\nA weekly introduction to poetry 
 covering haiku\, sonnet\, blank & free verse\, are covered in depth. Kids 
 will learn historical significance\, structure\, and grammatical 
 conventions. We'll write our own poetry and express ourselves in new ways. 
 With excerpts from The Odyssey\, Ozymandias\, Jabberwocky and more serving 
 as writing inspiration. Kids will also make art based on their poems\, 
 further demonstrating their creativity. Facilitated by poet Jack Jerow. 
 Registration recommended for reminders.\n\n
