SUMMARY:Land of the Rising Sun: Focus on Japan Online NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin us as we investigate the fascinating world of Japan with 
 a combined historical and geographic lens. Our exploration begins with an 
 examination of Japan’s tectonics and its location on the Ring of Fire. We 
 will then focus on the Ice Age\, ancient Japan\, and early European 
 encounters. Next\, a look at imperial Japan of the 20th century and its 
 post-World War II development. We will round out our discussion with a 
 focus on Japan’s contemporary challenges related to geopolitics\, 
 population\, natural disasters\, and economy.
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-16400393
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16400393
