SUMMARY:Craft Your Own Indian Hanging Mirror with Floral Border NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin art teacher Ajita Shah to create your own beautiful 
 hanging mirror with lippan techniques from the state of Rajasthan in India! 
 In our first class\, we'll roll strings of special clay to create the 
 mirror's dimensional floral border and glue them onto a 10" wooden round. 
 In the second class\, we'll paint our creations and add the large mirror 
 and embellish the frame with many tiny mirrors. You'll go home with a 
 lovely addition to your home or a very special present. \n
