DTSTAMP:20260507T000000Z
SUMMARY:Ink and Insight: Writing for Mental Health and Happiness NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJournaling is an incredible tool for nurturing mental health 
 and finding happiness. It allows us to reduce stress\, release emotions\, 
 build mindfulness\, and gain self-awareness—especially when it comes to 
 identifying unhealthy patterns or habits. There are countless ways to 
 approach journaling\, each offering its own unique benefits to support 
 better mental well-being.\n\nIn this two-session workshop\, we’ll explore 
 various journaling methods and delve into the specific advantages of each. 
 Together\, we’ll even dedicate time to put pen to paper and experience 
 the therapeutic power of journaling firsthand.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Personal Growth, Writing
