DTSTART:20260509T143000Z
DTEND:20260509T163000Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T000000Z
SUMMARY:Microsoft Excel 2
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nAbout Class\nExcel is Microsoft 365 software that organizes 
 and analyzes information in spreadsheet format. It has a wide array of 
 tools for data analysis.  Excel provides options for presenting complex 
 data via charts and graphs.\n\nThe class is geared to beginners and those 
 who seek a refresher in the topic.  Students will gain a basic 
 understanding of the worksheet environment\, tools for working with data\, 
 and resources for continued learning.\n\nWhat you will learn\nHow to format 
 the worksheet for an attractive\, easily-readable on-screen 
 presentation.\nSet specifications for printing\, to efficiently display 
 data.\n\nImportant Note\nThis is a hands-on class\; students should have 
 ability to use a mouse and keyboard.  Students are welcome to bring a flash 
 drive to save their work for review and practice.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
