SUMMARY:Tech Help Tuesdays: One-on-One Tech Help
DESCRIPTION:Drop in during this weekly open session for technology related 
 help on using your cellphone\, tablet\, or computer.\n\n\nWant to feel more 
 confident using technology? Join us for Tech Help Tuesdays—a casual\, 
 drop-in space where adults can receive one-on-one assistance with everyday 
 tech challenges. Come prepared with questions relating to your personal 
 devices!\n\nRegistration is required for a timeslot of 20-25 minutes per 
 patron. If registrations are full\, please check a future date\, as we 
 cannot accommodate walk-ins at this time.\n\nPlease note that some 
 technological issues may be above the ability of the library staff and you 
 may be referred out to a better suited tech professional. These drop-ins 
 are not professional IT services\, we cannot fix computers or smartphones.
