SUMMARY:[MILL Senior Friday] Understanding Opiates/Fentanyl with Essex Health & Wellness Center
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for a day full of events for Seniors with 
 the MILL @ MPL! All events are free and open to the public. Registration is 
 recommended unless otherwise noted.\n\n\nThe Essex Health and Wellness 
 Recovery Center will give a presentation on the opiate/fentanyl crisis in 
 America\, substance use prevention\, intervention and treatment\, and being 
 supportive to family members.\n\nHOW TO REGISTER\nThis class is run by the 
