 play the game during the week\, please register for the "Mah Jongg Meetup - 
 Weekly Thursday Morning" by clicking here\n\nIf you're new to the game\, 
 and would like to teach yourself at your own pace\, please register for the 
 "Teach Yourself Mah Jongg" by clicking here.\n
